{
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Live",
      "path": "live",
      "icon": "mdi:video",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Cameras",
              "icon": "mdi:cctv",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.YOUR_DEVICE_live_view",
              "name": "Front",
              "camera_view": "live",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.YOUR_DEVICE_rear_camera",
              "name": "Rear",
              "camera_view": "live",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "The dashcam streams over its own mobile data, and only while a camera is open. It can show one camera at a time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Status",
              "icon": "mdi:car-connected",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_online",
              "name": "Online",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_ignition",
              "name": "Ignition",
              "color": "amber"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
              "name": "Speed",
              "color": "blue",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "trend-graph",
                  "hours_to_show": 6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_last_seen",
              "name": "Last seen"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "button.YOUR_DEVICE_update_location",
              "name": "Update location",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "color": "cyan"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Location",
      "path": "location",
      "icon": "mdi:map-marker",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Where is it now",
              "icon": "mdi:map",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "map",
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "device_tracker.YOUR_DEVICE"
                }
              ],
              "default_zoom": 16,
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "theme_mode": "auto"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Trip",
              "icon": "mdi:speedometer",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
              "name": "Speed",
              "color": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_heading",
              "name": "Heading"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_altitude",
              "name": "Altitude"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_total_distance",
              "name": "Odometer",
              "color": "purple"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "History",
              "icon": "mdi:chart-line",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "history-graph",
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
                  "name": "Speed"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_ignition",
                  "name": "Ignition"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Media",
      "path": "media",
      "icon": "mdi:image-multiple",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Latest event",
              "icon": "mdi:alert-decagram",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_last_event",
              "name": "Front",
              "show_state": true
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_last_event_rear",
              "name": "Rear",
              "show_state": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Recordings",
              "icon": "mdi:folder-play",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Open **Media \u2192 Proof Plus** to browse:\n\n- **Cloud album** \u2014 everything stored in the cloud\n- **Impact events** \u2014 vibration/impact clips\n- **Collisions** \u2014 accident clips\n\nEach is split into **Videos** and **Images**, labelled by time and camera."
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Open media browser",
              "icon": "mdi:folder-multiple-image",
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/media-browser"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
